# Code owner rules are disabled by default. Every rule below is commented out, so no
# code owner review is required until a team deliberately enables one.
#
# To enforce code owner review: uncomment the rules you want and replace the placeholder
# handles with real GitHub teams or users. A handle that does not resolve cannot approve,
# so an active rule with a placeholder blocks every pull request permanently.
#
# Branch protection can require code owner review before this file is configured. With no
# active rule, no path has an owner, so there is nothing to satisfy and nothing to fail.

# *                           @your-org/app-team

# /security/                 @your-org/appsec-team
# /config/security-gate.yaml @your-org/appsec-team
# /.github/workflows/        @your-org/app-team @your-org/appsec-team
# /gitops/                   @your-org/app-team @your-org/platform-team
